## Quick Start

```bash
git clone {{REPO_URL}}
cd {{REPO_NAME}}
bash setup.sh
source venv/bin/activate
```

## Usage

```bash
# Search (no API key needed)
ckb search "your query"
ckb status

# AI-powered Q&A (needs Claude Pro/Max or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
ckb query "your question"
ckb interactive

# Recompile wiki
ckb compile --fast
```

## Authentication

**Claude Pro/Max** ($20-100/mo): Sign into Claude Code — auth is automatic.
**Anthropic API key**: `export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."`

